{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../PaidMediaPurchased/", "title": "PaidMediaPurchased"}, "next": {"link": "../InlineQuery/", "title": "InlineQuery"}, "title": "ChosenInlineResult", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"choseninlineresult\">\n<h1>ChosenInlineResult<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#choseninlineresult\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.ChosenInlineResult\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ChosenInlineResult</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.ChosenInlineResult\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>A <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../InlineQueryResult/\"><span class=\"doc\">result</span></a> of an inline query chosen by the user and sent to their chat partner.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition note\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Note</p>\n<p>In order to receive these updates, your bot must have \u201cinline feedback\u201d enabled.\nYou can enable this feature with <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://t.me/botfather\">&#64;BotFather</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>result_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 The unique identifier for the result that was chosen.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>from_user</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../User/#pyrogram.types.User\" title=\"pyrogram.types.User\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">User</span></code></a>) \u2013 The user that chose the result.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>query</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 The query that was used to obtain the result.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>location</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../Location/#pyrogram.types.Location\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Location\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Location</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Sender location, only for bots that require user location.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>inline_message_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Identifier of the sent inline message.\nAvailable only if there is an <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../InlineKeyboardMarkup/\"><span class=\"doc\">inline keyboard</span></a> attached to the message.\nWill be also received in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../CallbackQuery/\"><span class=\"doc\">callback queries</span></a> and can be used to edit the message.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>matches</strong> (<em>List of regex Matches, *optional*</em>) \u2013 A list containing all <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html#match-objects\">Match Objects</a> that match\nthe query of this inline query. Only applicable when using <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Filters.regex</span></code>.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/InlineQuery", "InlineQuery", "N", "next"], ["api/types/PaidMediaPurchased", "PaidMediaPurchased", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">ChosenInlineResult</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.ChosenInlineResult\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChosenInlineResult</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/types/ChosenInlineResult", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}